{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在北京，外交部表示，願同塞爾維亞新政府一道努力，推動兩國關係行穩致遠。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆說：「中方一貫秉持不干預內政原則，尊重各國人民的自主選擇。我們高度重視中塞關係發展，願同塞爾維亞新一屆政府一道努力，在相互尊重、平等互利基礎上，弘揚傳統友誼，鞏固政治互信，拓展務實合作，推動中塞關係行穩致遠。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:45.427586+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:18.134299+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:09.547725+00:00","content_hash":"5980845e5674d039eb1e07cc73d9cbbf9d8aafa50cd7fb775f8d9adaef1aab74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:45.427586+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}